### Dataset Attribution & Third-Party Notice
This project uses the publicly accessible e-commerce dark pattern dataset provided by Yamanalab:
"Dark Patterns in E-Commerce: a Dataset and Exploration" (Yamanalab, Waseda University), arXiv:2211.06543 (2022).
Repository: https://github.com/yamanalab/ec-darkpattern

This project is an academic research prototype designed for linguistic and NLP evaluation.
It does not claim to determine deceptive commercial intent solely from isolated text snippets.
